{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Dr. Morgan, I need to share the results of my room-safety review, which I completed this week. The review found that the makerspace may enroll no more than 16 students, and any session using soldering stations with more than 12 students requires two supervising adults. The draft program form still shows the original numbers of 24 students and one supervising adult, which would not meet these safety requirements."}
```

